# NovaDark — MoOS Konsole color scheme (Nova palette)
# Format verified verbatim against KDE/konsole master
# data/color-schemes/Breeze.colorscheme (groups: Background/Foreground with
# Faint+Intense variants, Color0..Color7 each with Faint+Intense, [General]).
# Colors are R,G,B from the Nova brand palette:
#   bg #0B1220  surface #111A2E  raised #1A2740  deepest #050A14
#   text #E6EDF7  secondary #9FB0C9
#   blue #2E7BFF  cyan #22D3EE  violet #8B5CF6
#   red #F87171  green #34D399  yellow #FBBF24

